OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowery rain
OL,6,Fat times along the east coast
OL,7,Fotherwise mostly dry with clear spells
OL,8,Fand light winds leading to some mist
OL,9,For freezing fog patches.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FEarly cloud and showery
OL,12,Frain along the east coast will soon
OL,13,Fclear to leave the day dry and bright
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,17,Fand cold with bright or sunny spells
OL,18,FThursday, less cold with increasing
OL,19,Fcloud Friday and Saturday becoming
OL,20,Fbreezy with increasing outbreaks of
OL,21,Fshowery rain later.
